00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:06,480
 I wanna provide a little bit more background there

473
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:08,880
 'cause I am formerly the chief legal officer

474
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:11,800
 of a DCM and a crypto spot market.

475
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:16,080
 So derivatives or futures are traded on DCMs.

476
00:20:16,080 --> 00:20:18,120
 So meaning that up until now,

477
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:21,720
 spot crypto trading in the US has not happened on DCMs.

478
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:25,600
 It's mainly happened on kind of crypto native platforms

479
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:28,480
 that aren't regulated by the CFTC or SEC.

